    <h1>Resume</h1>
    <p class="sub">Operating executive who scales multi-service businesses through constant market change, with an AI-first bias. Former VP of Client Services at NetReputation. Now a fractional consultant in reputation management, SEO, branding, and AI implementation.</p>

